WEBVTT

00:01:59.396 --> 00:02:01.183
So what I'm going to do here is,

00:02:01.207 --> 00:02:04.743
I cracked open an episode
of my radio show,

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.837
"99% Invisible," and I'm going
to reconstruct it here on stage,

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:10.127
so when I press a button over here --

00:02:10.151 --> 00:02:12.026
Voice: S for Sound --

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.951
Roman Mars: It's going to make a sound,

00:02:13.975 --> 00:02:17.040
and so whenever you hear a sound
or a voice or a piece of music,

00:02:17.064 --> 00:02:18.751
it's because I pressed a button.

00:02:18.775 --> 00:02:20.855
Voice: Sound.

00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:24.161
RM: All right, got it? Here we go.

00:02:24.719 --> 00:02:26.185
Three, two.

00:02:27.825 --> 00:02:31.631
This is 99% Invisible. I'm Roman Mars.